{"data": [{"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-30T10:09:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116110349531599229"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 133, "start": 127, "tag": "高山说缠论"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/IMSkVDYlHM", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2116110349531599229/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116110332854947840", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/IMSkVDYlHM"}]}, "id": "2116110349531599229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "币安中招黑天鹅再次来袭\n本次黑客盗币规模历史罕见\n美股财报周利空不断\n老美中期选举临近\n大饼日线回调走势逐步兑现中\n今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~\n\n#高山说缠论 https://t.co/IMSkVDYlHM", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2116110349531599229"}, {"author_id": "2114884465671712769", "created_at": "2026-10-30T19:10:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116246287838486967"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 19, "start": 15, "tag": "BTC"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/01pkPGbSmd", "end": 82, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Chanlun_G/status/2116246287838486967/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116246198885511168", "start": 59, "url": "https://t.co/01pkPGbSmd"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/01pkPGbSmd", "end": 82, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Chanlun_G/status/2116246287838486967/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116246198751252480", "start": 59, "url": "https://t.co/01pkPGbSmd"}]}, "id": "2116246287838486967", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【大G分析】10/31 凌晨 #BTC\n现价约76,450。有人问：为什么说4H还在下跌段？展开说清楚。\n\n一、结构 https://t.co/01pkPGbSmd", "url": "https://x.com/Chanlun_G/status/2116246287838486967"}, {"author_id": "1786121413767938048", "created_at": "2026-10-30T15:38:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116192919778648521"], "id": "2116192919778648521", "public_metrics": {"boo