, "impression_count": 20556, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/ripWZWIPRW\n\n《暗引力》by在言外\n《天堂岛》by月照夕\n《流年似水》by我思故我在\n《夜草生长》by佳鱼\n《朕与左相》by匿名咸鱼\n《有效真香》by酌青栀 ​​​\n\n【81章】《风吹草动》作者：任平生\n【最新章更38】《风中来信》 作者：絮语", "url": "https://x.com/bukethcgl/status/2116384103977361819"}, {"author_id": "1193643769020735494", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:23:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115977967197401109"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "迅雷云盘", "display_url": "pan.xunlei.com/s/VP54ErXgduZY…", "end": 46, "expanded_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP54ErXgduZYMMarrtL4KroSA1?pwd=76zt", "start": 23, "status": 200, "title": "迅雷", "unwound_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP54ErXgduZYMMarrtL4KroSA1?pwd=76zt", "url": "https://t.co/WhyxZrJIkp"}]}, "id": "2115977967197401109", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 99896, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/WhyxZrJIkp\n\n[更149]恶毒女配是要给女主做老婆的 作者：楚燎\n[更112]《锁定2》作者：宁与鹤\n[更110]仙人跳时不要省车费 作者：IBrnInu\n[更102]穿进限z文里养崽躺平失败后 作者：呆宝宝\n[更96]《九尾白狐是我前世妻》作者：hugoo\n[更92]变数 作者：九木", "url": "https://x.com/liamwwfc98/status/2115977967197401109"}, {"author_id": "1952942505399599108", "created_at": "2026-10-30T10:10:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116110524198834615"], "id": "2116110524198834615", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2018, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "前 Anthropic 研究员，现 Midjourney 研究员 Ivan Vendrov 撰写了一篇早期在 Anthropic 任职期间的回忆，引起了广泛的讨论。\n\n以下是回忆全文：\n\n一\n\n首先我要声明，以下所记录的经历均发生在 2022 年 10 月至 2023 年 5 月之间。", "url": "https://x.com/veryveryheli/status/2116110524198834615"}, {"author_id": "1521086568194211842", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:08:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116351514260504927"], "id": "2116351514260504927", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 264, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "曹操死后，曹丕刚坐上王位，先面对的不是外敌，而是自己的弟弟曹植。曹植曾是继承人的有力竞争者，才华横溢，却不善政治。曹丕以奔丧为由要杀他，最后给出的活路，是七步之内作诗。曹植写下“煮豆燃豆萁，豆在釜中泣。本是同根生，相煎何太急？”。这段情节未见于《三国志》，却因为太准确地说中了权力的", "url": "https://x.com/SonicAIWizard/status/2116351514260504927"}, {"author_id": "2065684739865071616", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:19:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116354363983859944"], "id": "2116354363983859944", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 84, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "6:Chinese and English \n若然五部殊业，存乎其人。人不经世，道或隆替。废兴有时，则互相升降。小大之目，其可定乎。", "url": "https://x.com/MWGA_GCF/status/2116354363983859944"}, {"author_id": "2065684739865071616", "created_at": "2026-10-30T08:22:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116083264771543181"], "id": "2116083264771543181", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1: Chinese and English\n达摩多罗禅经序1\n\n达摩多罗尊者讲的一套禅修方法指南，主要是把佛祖悉达多教的安那般那（呼吸观）和不净观（比如白骨观）这些法门，按阶段一步步说清楚：怎么通过打坐禅定，慢慢打开智慧，最后走向觉悟。\n\nThis is a meditation guide taught by Master Dharmatrāta. It mainly", "url": "https://x.com/MWGA_GCF/status/2116083264771543181"}, {"author_id": "1748602031248732160", "created_at": "2026-10-30T00:54:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115970643493875776"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hRiWcfFFDS", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/_zheergen/status/2115970643493875776/video/1", "media_key": "13_2115969485194846208", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/hRiWcfFFDS"}, {"display_url": "x.com/_zheergen/stat…", "end": 190, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/_zheergen/status/2115821371586678974", "start": 167, "url": "https://t.co/1eIipgpoLG"}]}, "id": "2115970643493875776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 179, "impression_count": 17332, "like_count": 155, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 42}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115821371586678974", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "卧槽！缠论里最复杂的分型、笔、中枢识别，居然有人全部用 Rust 重写了，还整合了 220 多个交易信号函数！\n\nCZSC，6.5K Stars，一套专门做缠论分析和量化策略研究的 Python 工具。\n\n以前研究缠论，最麻烦的就是手动画笔、找中枢、判断买卖点，不同周期还得反复对照。 https://t.co/hRiWcfFFDS https://t.co/1eIipgpoLG", "url": "https://x.com/_zheergen/status/2115970643493875776"}, {"author_id": "1505085782817533955", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:34:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116343085852418529"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 110, "start": 105, "tag": "AI量化"}]}, "id": "2116343085852418529", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论图表最吓人的不是画错，是每刷新就改写历史。\n\n行情中心缠论只读审查：笔间隔按合并前原始下标算，密集合并区会冒假笔；末笔/末段/中枢全当已确认画，新K一到结构原地替换。\n\n没有确认态的结构，只是会动的幻觉。\n#AI量化", "url": "https://x.com/kamerFo/status/2116343085852418529"}, {"author_id": "3105124455", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:52:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116513534721097737"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/wr0789/status/…", "end": 163, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/wr0789/status/2116362405370622424", "start": 140, "url": "https://t.co/qzSJ2urg9f"}]}, "id": "2116513534721097737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116362405370622424", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "学习总结：\n1.熊市确立，只能做冰冰复冰冰，左侧买点是缠论一买，右侧买点譬如缠论二买。\n2.当前大跌不可持续，乖离过大，反弹不远了。\n3.牛市是散户绞肉机，散户牛市高位敢上大仓位，亏的最狠\n4.牛市拉高是为了卖的，卖的时候一定是你觉得现在不可能结束的时间点，这样才能把货全出给你 https://t.co/qzSJ2urg9f", "url": "https://x.com/Leollllllllllll/status/2116513534721097737"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-30T00:57:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115971226338521187"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 57, "id": "10228272", "start": 49, "username": "YouTube"}], "urls": [{"description": "-币安广场/微博：高山说缠论-专注缠